 Get an item.
 
+#### .getOrInsertComputed(key, factory)
+
+Get an item, or synchronously compute and insert it when it is missing or expired.
+The `factory` is called with the key and its returned value uses the cache's default `maxAge`.
+When an item exists, the factory is not called and the item is marked as recently used like `.get()`.
+
 #### .has(key)
 
 Check if an item exists.
